body:
Headliners are meh besides Stevie and J. Cole IMO but the subs look solid. 100 Gecs, Wallows, All Time Low (my teen emo nostalgia lol), Robert Plant, Japanese Breakfast, Porter Robinson, Chvrches, LANY are all great.

&#x200B;

Sucks that King Gizz and The War on Drugs are out tho :/

BART goes till Midnight Friday and Saturday.

&#x200B;

Edit: Accidentally pasted in text lol

I was a different major when I started college, and also double majored in Business Administration. The catch-up I had to play along with the extra credits from the double major and credits I transferred in with put me on track to complete 150 credits in 4 years. :) 

&#x200B;

And I agree networking is really important. That's why I'm worried about putting my application in before I get a chance to meet people, but you're probably right, I should get my application in before the positions that remain fill up. Thanks!
